  "problem": "",
  "worked_solution": "We can solve this equation using the square root method:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(2q+1)^{2} & =0 \\\\ \\sqrt{(2q+1)^{2}} & =\\sqrt{0} \\\\ |2q+1| & =0 \\\\ 2q+1 & =0 \\\\ 2q & =-1 \\\\ q & =-\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
